# Local only, never published: Blizzard's textures, icons, map tiles, sounds and font, Ikar's screenshots, and data
# built from QuestieDB (GPL-3.0). The benches' scripts make them again from the local reference copies (README.md).
quest/bench/art/
quest/bench/js/fake-log.js
recipe/bench/art/
recipe/bench/js/data.js
hud/bench/art/

# The sheets KaLi HUD's cartouches and minimap rings are cut from (hud/tools/cut_art.py, make_cartouches.py,
# cut_rings.py, make_rings.py), images Ikar generated with Google Gemini: 56 MB, kept local unless Ikar chooses to
# publish them. The addon ships the pieces cut from them.
hud/art/

# The Lua runtime the test runners load (python -I -m pip install --target tools/pylib lupa), and Python's caches.
tools/pylib/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Editors' own files.
.vscode/
